:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)]].''
'''Wafer Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]] and can be unlocked by purchasing a special sale which contains this unit and 1 [[Cat Capsule|Rare Ticket]]. It was added to promote Japanese Battle Cats wafers.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 608
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Wafer Cat
|name2 = Wafer Cat XL
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Wafer Cat XL''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Use this unit how you would use [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]]: a one time debuffer that works best when either stalling slow backliners like [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] or [[Alpacky]], or stalling stronger frontliners (when there are no peons to get in the way). These feats are most prevalent in stages like [[Twilight Zephyr]] or [[Atrocious Deco]], although due to its Single Target nature and relatively long recharge time, this unit is still replaceable by more competent [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] when applicable.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

