==Trivia==
*Wafer Cat, [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Tank Cat]], [[PAC-MAN (Special Cat)|PAC-MAN]], [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]] and [[Li'l Clops Cat Egg (Special Cat)|Li'l Clops Cat Egg]] have the joint-lowest range out of all [[Cat Units]].
*This Cat is tied with [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] and [[Hell Warden Emma (Uber Rare Cat)|Hell Commissioner Emma]] for the third highest health out of all Cats, only beaten by [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] and [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Deathdealer]].

